# S12-T05: PresenceAvatars Component + Page Integration

## App-agent preflight

- [ ] `explain("work-control")` — presence + WS section
- [ ] Read board `[id].vue` + chat `[id].vue` — find header area for avatar injection
- [ ] Confirm T03 + T04 DONE

## Implementation

### PresenceAvatars.vue

```vue
<!-- Shows a stack of colored initials circles for each presence member.
     "You" (own presenceId) gets a distinct ring. Agents get their role color.
     Max 5 shown; "+N" overflow chip. Tooltip on hover: label + role. -->
<script setup lang="ts">
defineProps<{
  members: PresenceMember[]
  selfId: string
}>()
</script>
```

- Use `useAgentRoles()` for agent role → color mapping
- Human: neutral gray circle with label initials
- Agent: role color badge with role icon (e.g., i-lucide-radar for ROOT)
- Self member: ring highlight (2px ring-white/60)
- Overflow: show first 4 + "+N" chip
- Tooltip (UTooltip or title attr): label + role string

### Board page (`board/[id].vue`) integration

- `usePresenceId()` for self member
- Pass `member` to `useBoard()` which passes to `useRealtime()`
- Add `<PresenceAvatars :members="members" :self-id="presenceId" />` in board header
  (right side, next to WS indicator)

### Chat page (`chat/[id].vue`) integration

- Same pattern: `usePresenceId()` → pass to `useChats()` / `useRealtime()`
- Add `<PresenceAvatars>` in chat header

## Done when

- [ ] Two tabs on same board: both see 2 avatars (including self) in header
- [ ] Self member has ring; other user doesn't
- [ ] Closing tab: avatar disappears from the other tab within ~1 s
- [ ] Agent avatar appears on board during task run
- [ ] `bun run test` — component renders with mock members
